      "Text": "Security update for wicked2nm",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for wicked2nm fixes the following issue:\n\nUpdate to v1.5.2.\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n\n- `serde_with`: `KeyValueMap` serialization panics on empty sequence or map entries (bsc#1271848).\n\nOther updates and bugfixes:\n\n* Build(deps): bump `serde_with` from 3.18.0 to 3.21.0.\n* Fix flaky tests.\n* Fix `team_lacp_ethtool` test by setting `lacp active` explicitly.\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
